# rm003, the square's pup (test fixture): written for the talk town's Ridgemere pup; a young section, then grown lines
# for when she is grown.
mantle rm003
state ready
dialect plain
accent none
tier standard
written_for tt_ri_pup
title the square's pup
fits stage=young|adolescent|adult|old
traits talk=chatty humour=merry
quirk counts_the_cobbles
likes skipping_stones
dislikes baths
fears the_dark
hopes to_be_a_smith
topics day +.4
marks oath
persona #self.first# is a chatty, merry pup who counts the cobbles of the square.

words
oath! = Cobbles and crumbs | By my tail
greet = Hello | Hi there
farewell = Bye, then | See you

young
line tell.boast [concept=talk.day] : I counted the cobbles. There's four hundred and twelve. Maybe thirteen.
line greet.return : #greet#! Did you see me run?
line farewell.return : Bye! Bye!
line react.news.new : #oath#! Tell me again!
line react.news.known : I knew that. Everyone knows that.
line answer.how : Good! Hungry, though.

story cobbles [concept=talk.day]
  : I'm going to count every cobble in the square.
  b : Every one?
  : Every one. Then the lane. Then the whole city.
  b[old] : You'll be old as me by then.
  b : That's a lot of cobbles.

grown
line greet.return : #greet#. Watch the cobbles; they're slick.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Is that right?
line answer.how : Well enough, thanks.
